# Read AGENTS.md first

Before non-trivial patches, read **`AGENTS.md`** at the repo root (architecture, Firestore R/W, ops, encyclopedia update steps).

Hard constraints (also in AGENTS.md):

- Patch **only** `sevennight_guild_web_formal`. Live = **https://senalink.kr** (Firebase Hosting `senalink.web.app`, project **`senalink`**).
- Deploy Hosting/rules/functions **only** when 밍봉/김봉 asks.
- Do not open old copies (`sevennight_guild_web`, `*_backup*`) or other Firebase projects.
- **Never damage live user/hub data** — no reckless rules loosening, no wipe `setDoc`, no bulk delete on senalink. See AGENTS.md **§2.1**.
- Deck editor: skill order list height fixed in px; scroll only in `.skill-timeline-scroller`.
- Hero pick lists: **각성 → 스페셜(소속순) → 준스페셜(아스가르드·아이샤) → 일반** via `src/data/heroes.js` (`sortHeroesForList` / `compareHeroesForList`). See AGENTS.md §12.1.
- Bump `src/config/appVersion.js` when shipping a deploy. Deploy requests → skill **`senalink-deploy`**.
- **화면 테마** (유리 / 선명 다크) → **§10.8** in `docs/agents/features.md` (`uiTheme.js`, `themeSolidDark.css`, `UiThemeToggle`).
- **「미리보기 허브 켜줘」** / 로컬 허브 테스트 → **§4.1** `docs/agents/preview-hub.md` / skill **`senalink-preview-hub`** (에뮬레이터 + `npm run dev`, 라이브 데이터와 무관).
- Detailed sections (§4.1, §10, §12.2–12.5, §13, §17) live in `docs/agents/` — see AGENTS.md §1.1 문서 지도.
